    "voicelines": [
        {
            "type": "card_get",
            "text": "I want more memories with you.\nLet's create more memories together!♪",
            "audio": "resources/vo_live_dial_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_myself.acb/vo_live_dial_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_myself.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "situation",
            "text": "Oh, wow. I haven't read this one, but I've heard good things about it.\nI'm still reeling from the final plot twist from my last book! ...Hmm? What's up?\nOh, can't find a book you like?\nWell, it can certainly be hard, what with the sheer number of books in this library. Oh, I know!\nHow about I pick for you? What genres do you like?\nMystery? Sci-fi? Or maaaybe... you like derivatives, just like me?\nHehe, books are always the best mysteries. You never know what you're gonna get until you read them!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_situation.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_situation.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "skill",
            "text": "Are you ready? Let's play!!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_live_cmn_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_skill-card.acb/vo_live_cmn_card_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_skill-card.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_1",
            "text": "Do you like my outfit? It's kinda goth and kinda cool, and the frills are pretty cute!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-001.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-001.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_2",
            "text": "I love how dark it is in this library. I can sneak up behind people as much as I want in here!",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-002.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-002.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_3",
            "text": "Hey, I'd like to try something out from this book... Would you let me dissect you, please?",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-003.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-003.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_4",
            "text": "Ah, I'm reading that one as well. And the final book is... Haha, I know, I know. I won't spoil it.",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-004.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-004.mp3"
        },
        {
            "type": "potential_5",
            "text": "Let's go to that library again sometime. Promise? Don't you dare go by yourself now... Heehee.",
            "audio": "resources/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-005.acb/vo_card_cmn_04013_04013-5-uniq-0052-00_potential-005.mp3"
        }
    ],
